{"seq":2,"slug":"policy-testing-opa-sentinel","title":"策略测试（OPA/Sentinel）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/tools-frameworks/policy-testing-opa-sentinel","wordCount":1049,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"策略测试-opa-sentinel\">策略测试（OPA/Sentinel）</h1><p>策略即代码（Policy as Code）将组织的安全规则、合规要求和架构约束编码为机器可执行的规则。但策略代码本身也是代码——它也需要测试。未经测试的策略要么过于宽松（允许违规部署通过），要么过于严格（阻塞合法变更导致开发停滞）。本文探讨如何测试策略本身的正确性，以及三大策略引擎的测试方法论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>策略即代码（PaC）</strong>：将安全规则和合规要求编码为机器可执行的规则</li>\n<li><strong>OPA/Rego</strong>：通用策略引擎与其声明式策略语言，开源跨平台</li>\n<li><strong>Conftest</strong>：OPA 生态的 CI 集成 CLI，对结构化配置执行 Rego 策略</li>\n<li><strong>Sentinel</strong>：HashiCorp 商业策略引擎，嵌入 Terraform Cloud/Enterprise</li>\n<li><strong>CrossGuard</strong>：Pulumi 的策略框架，使用 TypeScript/Python 编写策略规则</li>\n<li><strong>策略测试金字塔</strong>：单条规则单元测试 → 多规则组合集成 → 真实管道端到端</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"策略引擎的格局-2026\">策略引擎的格局（2026）</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>引擎</th>\n<th>策略语言</th>\n<th>开源</th>\n<th>评估时机</th>\n<th>典型集成点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>OPA + Conftest</td>\n<td>Rego</td>\n<td>是（Apache-2.0）</td>\n<td>CI 管道 / 准入控制</td>\n<td>Terraform plan JSON、K8s、Dockerfile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HashiCorp Sentinel</td>\n<td>Sentinel</td>\n<td>否（商业）</td>\n<td>Terraform Cloud/Enterprise apply 阶段</td>\n<td>Terraform run 上下文</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pulumi CrossGuard</td>\n<td>TypeScript/Python</td>\n<td>是（核心开源）</td>\n<td><code>pulumi preview</code> / <code>pulumi up</code></td>\n<td>Pulumi stack 资源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kyverno</td>\n<td>YAML</td>\n<td>是（Apache-2.0）</td>\n<td>K8s 准入控制</td>\n<td>Kubernetes 资源</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"opa-与-conftest-通用策略测试\">OPA 与 Conftest：通用策略测试</h2><p>Open Policy Agent（OPA）使用 Rego 语言编写策略。Conftest 是 OPA 生态的 CLI 工具，专门用于在 CI 管道中对结构化配置（JSON/YAML/HCL）执行 Rego 策略。</p>\n<h3 id=\"编写可测试的-rego-策略\">编写可测试的 Rego 策略</h3><p>一个良好的 Rego 策略应遵循可测试性原则：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rego\" data-code=\"# policy/terraform/encryption.rego&#10;package terraform.encryption&#10;&#10;deny[msg] {&#10;    resource := input.resource_changes[_]&#10;    resource.type == &quot;aws_s3_bucket&quot;&#10;    not has_encryption(resource)&#10;    msg := sprintf(&quot;S3 桶 &#39;%s&#39; 必须启用服务端加密&quot;, [resource.name])&#10;}&#10;&#10;has_encryption(resource) {&#10;    resource.change.after.server_side_encryption_configuration != null&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># policy/terraform/encryption.rego</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>package terraform.encryption</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>deny[msg] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    resource := input.resource_changes[_]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    resource.type == \"aws_s3_bucket\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    not has_encryption(resource)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    msg := sprintf(\"S3 桶 '%s' 必须启用服务端加密\", [resource.name])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>has_encryption(resource) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    resource.change.after.server_side_encryption_configuration != null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"测试-rego-策略\">测试 Rego 策略</h3><p>OPA 内置测试框架，测试文件以 <code>_test.rego</code> 后缀命名：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rego\" data-code=\"# policy/terraform/encryption_test.rego&#10;package terraform.encryption&#10;&#10;test_deny_unencrypted_bucket {&#10;    input := {&quot;resource_changes&quot;: [{&#10;        &quot;type&quot;: &quot;aws_s3_bucket&quot;,&#10;        &quot;name&quot;: &quot;my-bucket&quot;,&#10;        &quot;change&quot;: {&quot;after&quot;: {&quot;server_side_encryption_configuration&quot;: null}}&#10;    }]}&#10;    count(deny) == 1&#10;}&#10;&#10;test_allow_encrypted_bucket {&#10;    input := {&quot;resource_changes&quot;: [{&#10;        &quot;type&quot;: &quot;aws_s3_bucket&quot;,&#10;        &quot;name&quot;: &quot;my-bucket&quot;,&#10;        &quot;change&quot;: {&quot;after&quot;: {&quot;server_side_encryption_configuration&quot;: {&quot;rule&quot;: [{}]}}}&#10;    }]}&#10;    count(deny) == 0&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># policy/terraform/encryption_test.rego</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>package terraform.encryption</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>test_deny_unencrypted_bucket {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    input := {\"resource_changes\": [{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"type\": \"aws_s3_bucket\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"name\": \"my-bucket\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"change\": {\"after\": {\"server_side_encryption_configuration\": null}}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }]}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    count(deny) == 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>test_allow_encrypted_bucket {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    input := {\"resource_changes\": [{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"type\": \"aws_s3_bucket\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"name\": \"my-bucket\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"change\": {\"after\": {\"server_side_encryption_configuration\": {\"rule\": [{}]}}}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }]}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    count(deny) == 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>执行测试：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 运行所有策略测试&#10;opa test ./policy/ -v&#10;&#10;# 带覆盖率报告&#10;opa test ./policy/ --coverage --format=json\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 运行所有策略测试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">opa</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ./policy/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -v</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 带覆盖率报告</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">opa</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ./policy/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --coverage</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --format=json</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"conftest-在-ci-中的集成\">Conftest 在 CI 中的集成</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant Dev as 开发者&#10;    participant CI as CI 管道&#10;    participant OPA as Conftest/OPA&#10;&#10;    Dev-&gt;&gt;CI: 提交 Terraform 代码&#10;    CI-&gt;&gt;CI: terraform plan -out=tfplan&#10;    CI-&gt;&gt;CI: terraform show -json tfplan &gt; plan.json&#10;    CI-&gt;&gt;OPA: conftest test plan.json --policy ./policy/&#10;    OPA--&gt;&gt;CI: PASS / FAIL + 违规详情&#10;    CI--&gt;&gt;Dev: 门禁结果\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Dev as 开发者\n    participant CI as CI 管道\n    participant OPA as Conftest/OPA\n\n    Dev-&gt;&gt;CI: 提交 Terraform 代码\n    CI-&gt;&gt;CI: terraform plan -out=tfplan\n    CI-&gt;&gt;CI: terraform show -json tfplan &gt; plan.json\n    CI-&gt;&gt;OPA: conftest test plan.json --policy ./policy/\n    OPA--&gt;&gt;CI: PASS / FAIL + 违规详情\n    CI--&gt;&gt;Dev: 门禁结果</pre><p>Conftest 支持的输入格式覆盖了几乎所有 IaC 工件：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>格式</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>JSON</td>\n<td>Terraform plan output、K8s manifests</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>YAML</td>\n<td>Helm values、Kustomize output</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HCL</td>\n<td>Terraform 源码直接解析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Dockerfile</td>\n<td>容器构建定义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INI/TOML</td>\n<td>应用配置文件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"hashicorp-sentinel-嵌入式策略测试\">HashiCorp Sentinel：嵌入式策略测试</h2><p>Sentinel 是 HashiCorp 的商业策略引擎，紧密集成在 Terraform Cloud/Enterprise 中。它的测试方法不同于 OPA——使用 JSON 格式的 mock 数据来模拟 Terraform run 上下文：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"# 策略文件：require-tags.sentinel&#10;import &quot;tfplan/v2&quot; as tfplan&#10;&#10;required_tags = [&quot;Environment&quot;, &quot;Owner&quot;, &quot;CostCenter&quot;]&#10;&#10;main = rule {&#10;    all tfplan.resource_changes as _, rc {&#10;        rc.type is &quot;aws_instance&quot; implies&#10;            all required_tags as tag {&#10;                rc.change.after.tags contains tag&#10;            }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 策略文件：require-tags.sentinel</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import \"tfplan/v2\" as tfplan</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>required_tags = [\"Environment\", \"Owner\", \"CostCenter\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>main = rule {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    all tfplan.resource_changes as _, rc {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        rc.type is \"aws_instance\" implies</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            all required_tags as tag {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                rc.change.after.tags contains tag</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Sentinel 测试使用 <code>sentinel test</code> 命令，测试文件提供模拟的 plan 数据：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"// test/require-tags/pass.json&#10;{&#10;  &quot;mock&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;tfplan/v2&quot;: &quot;mock-tfplan-pass.sentinel&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;test&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;main&quot;: true&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// test/require-tags/pass.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"mock\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"tfplan/v2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"mock-tfplan-pass.sentinel\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"test\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"main\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"pulumi-crossguard-编程语言的策略测试\">Pulumi CrossGuard：编程语言的策略测试</h2><p>CrossGuard 的独特优势在于策略与基础设施代码使用同一语言（TypeScript/Python），因此测试也使用同一语言的测试框架：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// policy-pack/index.ts&#10;import { PolicyPack, validateResourceOfType } from &#39;@pulumi/policy&#39;;&#10;import * as aws from &#39;@pulumi/aws&#39;;&#10;&#10;new PolicyPack(&#39;security-policies&#39;, {&#10;  policies: [&#10;    {&#10;      name: &#39;s3-no-public-read&#39;,&#10;      description: &#39;禁止 S3 桶设置公共读权限&#39;,&#10;      enforcementLevel: &#39;mandatory&#39;,&#10;      validateResource: validateResourceOfType(aws.s3.Bucket, (bucket, args, reportViolation) =&gt; {&#10;        if (bucket.acl === &#39;public-read&#39; || bucket.acl === &#39;public-read-write&#39;) {&#10;          reportViolation(&#39;S3 桶不得设置公共读/写 ACL&#39;);&#10;        }&#10;      }),&#10;    },&#10;  ],&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// policy-pack/index.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { PolicyPack, validateResourceOfType } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@pulumi/policy'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> aws </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@pulumi/aws'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PolicyPack</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'security-policies'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  policies: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'s3-no-public-read'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      description: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'禁止 S3 桶设置公共读权限'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      enforcementLevel: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'mandatory'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      validateResource: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">validateResourceOfType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(aws.s3.Bucket, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">bucket</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">args</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">reportViolation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (bucket.acl </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'public-read'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bucket.acl </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'public-read-write'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">          reportViolation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'S3 桶不得设置公共读/写 ACL'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>CrossGuard 策略的本地测试：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 在 preview 阶段执行策略检查&#10;pulumi preview --policy-pack ./policy-pack\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 在 preview 阶段执行策略检查</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pulumi</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> preview</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --policy-pack</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ./policy-pack</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"策略测试的分层模型\">策略测试的分层模型</h2><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>g</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Coverage_{policy} = \\frac{N_{tested\\_rules}}{N_{total\\_rules}} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">cy</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4933em;vertical-align:-1.053em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4403em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.757em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.053em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>策略测试也应遵循金字塔原则：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>验证内容</th>\n<th>方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单元</td>\n<td>单条规则的逻辑正确性</td>\n<td><code>opa test</code> / Sentinel mock / Jest</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集成</td>\n<td>多条规则的组合效果</td>\n<td>完整 plan JSON 作为输入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>端到端</td>\n<td>策略在真实管道中的阻断效果</td>\n<td>CI 管道中验证违规部署被拒绝</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>策略测试中最容易遗忘的是<strong>负测试</strong>——确保合法的部署不被错误拒绝。每条 deny 规则都应同时有 pass 和 fail 两组测试数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"策略版本管理与分发\">策略版本管理与分发</h2><p>成熟的策略管理将策略包作为独立制品发布：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>OPA/Conftest</strong>：通过 OCI 镜像仓库分发策略包（<code>conftest push/pull</code>）</li>\n<li><strong>Sentinel</strong>：通过 Terraform Registry 或 VCS 集成分发</li>\n<li><strong>CrossGuard</strong>：作为 npm/pip 包发布，版本化依赖</li>\n</ul>\n<p>策略包的版本升级应触发完整的测试套件运行，确保新版本不引入误拒。关于如何将策略测试工具与其他 IaC 测试工具组合，参见 <a href=\"terratest-pulumi-testing\">Terratest 与 Pulumi 测试</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>策略代码和应用代码一样需要测试——未经测试的策略不是可信的安全保障。OPA/Conftest 适合跨平台通用场景，Sentinel 紧密集成 Terraform Cloud 工作流，CrossGuard 利用通用编程语言的测试生态。无论选择哪个引擎，都应遵循策略测试金字塔：每条规则的正面和负面单元测试、多规则组合的集成测试、以及在真实管道中验证阻断效果的端到端测试。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"策略测试（OPA/Sentinel）","id":"策略测试-opa-sentinel"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"策略引擎的格局（2026）","id":"策略引擎的格局-2026"},{"level":2,"text":"OPA 与 Conftest：通用策略测试","id":"opa-与-conftest-通用策略测试"},{"level":3,"text":"编写可测试的 Rego 策略","id":"编写可测试的-rego-策略"},{"level":3,"text":"测试 Rego 策略","id":"测试-rego-策略"},{"level":3,"text":"Conftest 在 CI 中的集成","id":"conftest-在-ci-中的集成"},{"level":2,"text":"HashiCorp Sentinel：嵌入式策略测试","id":"hashicorp-sentinel-嵌入式策略测试"},{"level":2,"text":"Pulumi CrossGuard：编程语言的策略测试","id":"pulumi-crossguard-编程语言的策略测试"},{"level":2,"text":"策略测试的分层模型","id":"策略测试的分层模型"},{"level":2,"text":"策略版本管理与分发","id":"策略版本管理与分发"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Terratest 与 Pulumi 测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/tools-frameworks/terratest-pulumi-testing"},"next":{"title":"容器镜像测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/tools-frameworks/container-image-testing"}}